[{:doc/doc_type "business-model-projection", :doc/body "# cloud-itonami — business model / lean canvas\n\n<!-- generated by gftd cli (70-tools/bmc, ADR-2607021600).\n     正本 = 90-docs/adr/2607021500-portfolio-bmc-lean.datoms.edn + canvas ledger.\n     手編集禁止 — `gftd canvas add|retract|note` / `gftd hyp pass|fail` で編集し再生成する。 -->\n\n**Layer**: L3 business operator（全業種・職種 SaaS + investment platform）  \n**As-of**: 2026-07-19  \n**Prose 解説**: `90-docs/adr/2607021500-portfolio-bmc-lean.datoms.edn`\n\n## Problem\n\n- 業務 SaaS は職種ごとに分断され判断の脈絡が消える\n- AI agent 導入は「誰が何を承認したか」が残らずコンプラ不能\n- 中小には CFO/法務/営業 ops の専任が居ない\n- AI/Agent導入における『意思決定のブラックボックス化』と『責任所在の不明確さ』によるコンプライアンス障壁\n- Refine problem validation: segment traffic by human vs. probe. Add 'signal-to-noise ratio' to problem observation. Implement explicit User-Agent handling to reduce 91% 4xx probe noise.\n- Filter probe traffic (UA handling + rate limiting) to establish baseline human engagement & signal-to-noise ratio\n- 核心問題を『意思決定のブラックボックス化』から『監査・コンプライアンス対応のコストとリスク』に再定義。最初の 10 org に対する問題深刻度スコアリングを開始。\n- Refine problem validation by segmenting traffic signals (human vs. probe). Implement explicit User-Agent handling & rate limiting to establish baseline engagement. Begin problem_severity_scoring for the first 10 orgs.\n- 観測 (signal): itonami.cloud 実測 667 req/7d・77 uniques(日次和)・うち4xx probe 60%(24h)\n- 観測 (signal): itonami.cloud 実測 668 req/7d・78 uniques(日次和)・うち4xx probe 64%(24h)\n- 観測 (signal): itonami.cloud 実測 668 req/7d・78 uniques(日次和)・うち4xx probe 78%(24h)\n\n## Customer Segments\n\n- 中小企業の経営者・operator\n- 業種 vertical (26 ISIC blueprint)\n- 投資家・ファンド (investment platform)\n- gftdcojp 自身 (first customer)\n- Pilot 'deal flow ledger' module with 2 seed funds; map SPV management fee model to existing governance pattern\n- 初期購入セグメントを『SPV/ファンド運用者』及び『監査必須の中小事業主』に特定。26 ISIC blueprint 中、金融/士業/コンプライアンス密集業種へ優先展開。\n\n## Unique Value Proposition\n\n- 全業種・職種を同一 activity→decision→effect→audit log に載せる業務 OS\n- AI proposal ⊣ Governor 検閲 ⊣ 人間承認 — 監査台帳つき business agent\n- UVP: '監査不可避な業務の意思決定を、Governor+不変台帳で即座に可視化・保存。SMB operator & SPV 管理者のためのコンプライアンス・ナッシングな業務 OS'。\n\n## Solution\n\n- cockpit itonami.cloud (Pages 稼働済)\n- langgraph-clj StateGraph actor + 独立 Governor + 不変台帳 (3 実例で確立)\n- 職種 actor 群 (com-etzhayyim-*) の module 化\n- investment: deal flow を同じ decision ledger に載せる\n- 準備 (itonami-smb-pay): 初期 vertical の絞り込み\n- 準備 (itonami-smb-pay): 外部オンボーディング導線\n- 準備 (itonami-smb-pay): per-seat billing\n- 計器 (funnel): trial org の計測（funnel emitter で funnel/trials を出力）\n- 計器 (funnel): onboarded org の計測（funnel emitter で tenants/active を出力）\n- 計器 (funnel): 外部有償 org の計測（funnel emitter で tenants/external-paid を出力）\n- 監査適合性を保証する『Governor + 不変台帳』を備えた、業種別(ISIC)業務エージェント・オペレーティングシステム\n- Deploy free_path → checkout_initiation auto-trigger at 80% agent-run quota. Implement trial-to-paid nudge sequence & Stripe subscription status sync via webhook.\n\n## Channels\n\n- gftdcojp 実運用の公開 (build in public)\n- 業種 blueprint 直販\n- kotobase/murakumo 顧客への cross-sell\n- 士業・SIer パートナー\n- GTM (acquisition→revenue): onboarded org→外部有償 org 転換 0% < 目標 20% — trial→paid の nudge（使用量到達通知）・価格 tier 見直し・年額/上位 tier の提示\n- Product-Led Growth (PLG) via Free-Path: 'Free Claim' からの自動オンボーディング導線\n- Pivot channel focus to 'paid path optimization': implement checkout nudge triggers at usage thresholds, add annual/upper-tier pricing tier, and configure Stripe webhook for subscription status sync.\n- Deploy 'Free Claim' → checkout initiation auto-trigger at 80% agent-run quota & implement trial-to-paid nudge sequence\n- 外部有償 org 向け 'Paid Pilot' チャネル: 直接オンボーディング導線 (/isco-1212/) の強化、使用方法のドキュメント化、および 1on1 onboarding call の提供。\n- Implement checkout_nudge_triggers at 80% quota threshold, configure annual/upper-tier pricing tiers, deploy trial-to-paid nudge sequence, document /isco-1212/ external paid onboarding flow & 1on1 call booking\n- 観測 (paths): 上位 page (24h, 2xx/3xx): /robots.txt 2 · /itonami/verticals 1 · /join/browser 1 | 4xx(probe) 64%\n- 観測 (paths): 上位 page (24h, 2xx/3xx): /robots.txt 2 · /itonami/verticals 1 · /join/browser 1 | 4xx(probe) 60%\n- 観測 (paths): 上位 page (24h, 2xx/3xx): /join/browser 1 · /robots.txt 1 | 4xx(probe) 78%\n\n## Revenue Streams\n\n- per-seat + per-agent-run SaaS\n- vertical module subscription (業種・職種パック)\n- investment platform: deal fee / SPV 管理料 / carry\n- enterprise audit 契約\n- Operationalize revenue model: deploy per-seat + per-agent-run billing via Stripe. Introduce vertical module add-ons. Set initial price anchor based on 'CFO/legal ops substitute' value prop.\n- Stripe billing integration & checkout nudge triggers (usage thresholds, annual tier) to bridge free-path to paid\n\n## Cost Structure\n\n- LLM 推論費 (murakumo/router)\n- kotobase storage\n- vertical blueprint 保守\n- sales\n- compliance\n\n## Key Metrics\n\n- active orgs\n- agent runs/day\n- 人間承認 SLA\n- 台帳の外部監査適合率\n- vertical attach 数\n- deal count / AUM\n- 次の検証 (itonami-smb-pay): gftdcojp 外の初期 10 org の有償転換\n- gate 距離 (itonami-smb-pay): 外部有償 org 数 = 0 (gate 未到達)\n- funnel (cloud-itonami): trial org=0 → onboarded org=0 → 外部有償 org=0 | 転換 \n- funnel (cloud-itonami): trial org=2 → onboarded org=2 → 外部有償 org=0 | 転換 trial org→onboarded org 100% / onboarded org→外部有償 org 0%\n- funnel (cloud-itonami): trial org=4 → onboarded org=4 → 外部有償 org=0 | 転換 trial org→onboarded org 100% / onboarded org→外部有償 org 0%\n- Conversion Rate: Trial/Onboarded → External Paid (Current: 0% | Target: 20%)\n- Add 'checkout_completion_rate' & 'stripe_webhook_success_rate' to metrics. Update funnel to track 'free_path → checkout_initiated → subscription_active'.\n- funnel (cloud-itonami): trial→paid conversion rate tracking added. Target: ≥20% paid conversion within first 10 external orgs. Add metric: checkout_abandonment_rate & problem_fit_score (qualitative from first 4 orgs).\n- traffic_signal_quality (human/total ratio post-filter), checkout_abandonment_rate, stripe_webhook_success_rate, problem_fit_score (qualitative 1-5 scale from first 4 orgs)\n\n## Unfair Advantage\n\n- 職種 actor 数百 repo + 26 ISIC blueprint が既に存在\n- governor 封じ込めパターンは規制業種にそのまま売れる\n- 台帳 = switching cost\n- Data Network Effect: 蓄積される『decision ledger（意思決定台帳）』による、後続の業種/職種への適応速度の加速度的向上\n- Instrument 'decision_ledger_accumulation_rate' as a leading indicator of unfair advantage. Tie vertical module onboarding speed to accumulated cross-industry decision patterns.\n- Instrument 'decision_ledger_accumulation_rate' & tie vertical onboarding speed to cross-industry pattern reuse\n- Instrument decision_ledger_accumulation_rate as a leading indicator. Tie vertical module onboarding speed to cross-industry decision pattern reuse rate.\n\n## Hypotheses\n\n| id | risk | status | claim | gate | evidence |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| `:hyp/itonami-smb-pay` | riskiest | measuring | 中小 operator が監査台帳つき agent に per-seat で払う | gftdcojp 外の初期 10 org の有償転換 | gate instrumented: tenants.external-paid=0 via /api/fleet/metrics; readyForLiveCheckout true (live Stripe); freePath productSurface 5716/5716 |\n", :doc/title "cloud-itonami — business model / lean canvas", :doc/product :cloud-itonami, :doc/as-of "2026-07-19", :doc/source "gftd canvas (ADR-2607021600); SSoT = portfolio BMC datoms + canvas-ledger", :db/id -1, :doc/path "90-docs/business/cloud-itonami-business-model.edn", :doc/layer :business-operator, :doc/id "business-model-cloud-itonami"}]